"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverLandscape.png", "id": "443437561075004", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75580070_443437564408337_6207399824729004018_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S6q56ZMxJqUQ7kNvwHmJpM7&_nc_oc=AdqboZhvgcIgCtKrZEjeZmyB5FSl5QQDvalhpZggghMPelqQzv4fC3DqZ94PCSGkA9E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_MZ5NOy1Sb83otbCw6fL0W1W8mvfTFbgEWyILeN1u35g&oe=6A3E86D7"}, "display_name": "3D scan of the Verdon's canyon", "keywords": ["photogrammetry", "reconstruction", "360camera", "digitization", "scan"], "long_description": "Move like a kayaker in the canyon of the Verdon, reconstructed from videos taken by a helmet-held 360 camera, whose trajectory is about 2.5km long.\n\nRight controller:\n- Rotate on the left or right by using the joystick\n- Update the vertical offset (up or down) by using the joystick\n- Choose a location and teleport to it by using the virtual laser pointer\n- Teleport by using the index trigger only if the laser is green (not red)\n\nLeft controller:\n- Move continuously by using the joystick\n- Switch pannel and map by using the grip/hand trigger\n- If both map and pannel are disabled, switch between rendering modes (texturing or normal colors) by pressing the index trigger\n- The map shows the cloud of mesh vertices and the user location\n- If the pannel is enabled, switch between constrained and unconstrained motions by pressing the index trigger\n- The constrained motion controls your height above the ground\n- The pannel shows information about the 3D model and the selected motion.\n", "short_description": "Move continuously like a kayaker in the canyon of the Verdon, which was computed by photogrammetry from a cubemap video (4096x1344x2) taken by a helmet-held 360 camera (Gopro Max) and by kayaking about 2.5km."}]}, "developer_name": "Maxime Lhuillier", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://maximelhuillier.fr/", 